{
  "info": {
    "name": "Qistass Pay API",
    "description": "طلبات جاهزة لاختبار API بوابة الدفع الخاصة بقسطاس باي (pay.qistass.com) مباشرة، دون كتابة أي كود. عبّئ متغيرات البيئة المرفقة (qistass-pay.postman_environment.json) بمفاتيحك الحقيقية قبل التجربة.\n\nالتوثيق الكامل: https://pay.qistass.com/developers/",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "https://pay.qistass.com" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "إنشاء طلب دفع",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"public_key\": \"{{public_key}}\",\n  \"secret_key\": \"{{secret_key}}\",\n  \"merchant_number\": \"{{merchant_number}}\",\n  \"amount\": 45000,\n  \"order_id\": \"ORD-DEMO-0001\",\n  \"webhook_url\": \"https://yoursite.com/webhook/qistass\",\n  \"callback_url\": \"https://yoursite.com/payment/return\"\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/create-payment-order",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "create-payment-order"]
        },
        "description": "قيمة \"amount\" تُحسب بعملة التاجر نفسه (المحددة في لوحة تحكمه على قسطاس باي)، وليست دائمًا بالليرة السورية.\n\n\"webhook_url\" و\"callback_url\" اختياريان."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "نجاح — تم إنشاء الطلب",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/create-payment-order" }
          },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"payment_created\",\n  \"redirect_url\": \"https://pay.qistass.com/payment-process?payment_id=...\",\n  \"transaction_id\": \"a1b2c3d4-...\"\n}"
        },
        {
          "name": "خطأ — تاجر غير موجود",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/create-payment-order" }
          },
          "status": "Bad Request",
          "code": 400,
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"merchant_not_found\",\n  \"message\": \"...\"\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "التحقق من حالة الدفع",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"public_key\": \"{{public_key}}\",\n  \"secret_key\": \"{{secret_key}}\",\n  \"merchant_number\": \"{{merchant_number}}\",\n  \"transaction_id\": \"a1b2c3d4-...\"\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/payment-verification",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "payment-verification"]
        },
        "description": "يجب استدعاء هذا الطلب دائمًا من جانب الخادم قبل تفعيل أي طلب — لا يُعتمد على رابط العودة أو الـ webhook وحدهما، فكلاهما قابل للتزوير أو التكرار."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "نجاح — الدفع مؤكَّد",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/payment-verification" }
          },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n  \"payment_record\": {\n    \"is_paid\": 1,\n    \"amount\": 45000,\n    \"transaction_id\": \"a1b2c3d4-...\"\n  }\n}"
        },
        {
          "name": "غير موجود — لم يُعثر على العملية",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/payment-verification" }
          },
          "status": "Not Found",
          "code": 404,
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n  \"errors\": \"Payment record not found\"\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "إنشاء اشتراك (فوترة متكررة)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"public_key\": \"{{public_key}}\",\n  \"secret_key\": \"{{secret_key}}\",\n  \"merchant_number\": \"{{merchant_number}}\",\n  \"amount\": 9990,\n  \"subscription_id\": \"user_42\",\n  \"webhook_url\": \"https://yoursite.com/webhook/qistass-subscription\",\n  \"callback_url\": \"https://yoursite.com/account?subscribed=1\"\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/create-subscription",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "create-subscription"]
        },
        "description": "دورة شهرية ثابتة، بعملة التاجر نفسه. \"subscription_id\" هو مرجعك الخاص (مثلًا معرّف المستخدم عندك) — يُستخدم لاحقًا بأحداث الـ webhook لتحديد أي زبون عندك يخصّه الحدث.\n\nالرابط الناتج (redirect_url) هو نفس تدفق تأكيد PIN المعروف — لا واجهة جديدة، ولا شحن فعلي حتى يأكّد الزبون بنفسه."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "نجاح — تم إنشاء الاشتراك",
          "originalRequest": { "method": "POST", "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/create-subscription" } },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"subscription_created\",\n  \"subscription_id\": \"6f94ba33-...\",\n  \"redirect_url\": \"https://pay.qistass.com/payment-process?payment_id=...\"\n}"
        },
        {
          "name": "تكرار — subscription_id مستخدم أصلًا",
          "originalRequest": { "method": "POST", "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/create-subscription" } },
          "status": "Conflict",
          "code": 409,
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"duplicate_subscription_id\",\n  \"subscription_id\": \"6f94ba33-...\"\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "حالة الاشتراك",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"public_key\": \"{{public_key}}\",\n  \"secret_key\": \"{{secret_key}}\",\n  \"merchant_number\": \"{{merchant_number}}\",\n  \"subscription_id\": \"user_42\"\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/subscription-status",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "subscription-status"]
        },
        "description": "يقبل إما subscription_id الذي أعادته قسطاس باي، أو subscription_id الذي أرسلته أنت أصلًا عند الإنشاء."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "نجاح",
          "originalRequest": { "method": "POST", "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/subscription-status" } },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n  \"subscription\": {\n    \"id\": \"6f94ba33-...\",\n    \"status\": \"active\",\n    \"amount\": 9990,\n    \"currency_id\": 1,\n    \"interval\": \"monthly\",\n    \"next_billing_at\": \"2026-09-29T18:08:22+03:00\",\n    \"failed_attempts\": 0\n  }\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "إلغاء الاشتراك",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"public_key\": \"{{public_key}}\",\n  \"secret_key\": \"{{secret_key}}\",\n  \"merchant_number\": \"{{merchant_number}}\",\n  \"subscription_id\": \"user_42\"\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/cancel-subscription",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "cancel-subscription"]
        },
        "description": "إلغاء فوري ونهائي — بلا شحن لاحق. Idempotent: تكرار الإلغاء يرجّع already_canceled بدل خطأ. ملاحظة: الزبون قادر يلغي اشتراكه بنفسه أيضًا من طرفه، مستقلًا عن هذا الطلب."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "نجاح",
          "originalRequest": { "method": "POST", "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/cancel-subscription" } },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"canceled\"\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "التحقق من توقيع الـ Webhook (مرجع)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"order_id\": \"ORD-DEMO-0001\",\n  \"transaction_id\": \"a1b2c3d4-...\",\n  \"status\": \"paid\",\n  \"amount\": 45000\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "url": { "raw": "https://yoursite.com/webhook/qistass", "host": ["yoursite.com"], "path": ["webhook", "qistass"] },
        "description": "هذا الطلب لا يُرسَل فعليًا من هنا — الـ webhook حقيقةً يصلك من قسطاس باي على الرابط الذي حددته أنت (webhook_url). أُضيف هنا فقط كمرجع لشكل الحمولة (payload) وطريقة التحقق من التوقيع، عبر ترويسة X-Qistass-Signature (HMAC-SHA256 محسوبة على الجسم الخام للطلب باستخدام webhook_secret الخاص بك)."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// مثال حساب التوقيع محليًا للمقارنة اليدوية (ليس جزءًا من طلب حقيقي):",
              "const CryptoJS = require('crypto-js');",
              "const rawBody = pm.request.body.raw;",
              "const secret = pm.environment.get('webhook_secret') || '';",
              "const signature = CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(rawBody, secret).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Hex);",
              "console.log('X-Qistass-Signature المتوقعة:', signature);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
